     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>Thanks ALTUNA, a bit more explanation about the design of WGBS experiment. We have 4 different animals (cows) which are divided into two different groups on the basis of their phenotypes. Group 1 has two different animals and Group 2 has two other different animals. DNA has been extracted from these 4 animals (4 different samples of DNA). Then 3 sequencing libraries of each of these samples were prepared and sequenced. </div><div>Group 1  has six samples:-  G1_Cow1_Lib1,   G1_Cow1_Lib2,  G1_Cow1_Lib3,   G1_Cow2_Lib1,   G1_Cow2_Lib2,  G1_Cow2_Lib3.    </div><div>Group 2  has six samples:-  G2_Cow3_Lib1,   G2_Cow3_Lib2,  G2_Cow3_Lib3,   G2_Cow4_Lib1,   G2_Cow4_Lib2,  G2_Cow4_Lib3.     </div><div><br></div><div>Now we have total 12 samples and six samples in each group and two different cows in each group and each cow has three sequence libraries (of the same DNA sample).</div><div><br></div><div>I want to calculate differential DNA methylation between Group 1 and Group 2 by using methylKit. </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">1) What is your </span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Segoe UI, Segoe WP, Segoe UI WPC, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">recommendation now to proceed further? </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Segoe UI, Segoe WP, Segoe UI WPC, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">2) If pool is required then how to </span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">pool the replicates for each sample and then use the regular logistic regression based test (e.g. code)?</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">Thanks.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">Naveed Jhamat,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI WPC&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">PhD student.</span></div></div>"
